WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:14.209
The sky was gray.

2
00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:18.011
A strong wind blew.

3
00:00:18.012 --> 00:00:28.079
Eddy drove across the parking lot.

4
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.055
"Hi, Eddy," said Dipper.

5
00:00:31.056 --> 00:00:36.811
"Want to play tag?"

6
00:00:36.812 --> 00:00:40.466
"No, thanks," said Eddy.

7
00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:43.739
"I'm busy."

8
00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:45.535
Honk! Honk!

9
00:00:45.536 --> 00:00:48.449
Poppy zoomed over to Eddy.

10
00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:55.260
"Hey, Eddy!" she said.

11
00:00:55.261 --> 00:00:58.058
"Want to hear a joke?"

12
00:00:58.059 --> 00:01:02.349
"Not right now," said Eddy.

13
00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:06.460
"I have something to do."

14
00:01:06.461 --> 00:01:09.038
Eddy drove past Jeb.

15
00:01:09.039 --> 00:01:10.890
Jeb was digging.

16
00:01:10.891 --> 00:01:14.270
"Hi, Eddy," said Jeb.

17
00:01:14.271 --> 00:01:17.091
"Want to play in the dirt?"

18
00:01:17.092 --> 00:01:20.066
"Not now," said Eddy.

19
00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:24.499
"I'm busy."

20
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.440
Eddy drove onto the racetrack.

21
00:01:27.441 --> 00:01:31.602
The racetrack was empty.

22
00:01:31.603 --> 00:01:40.491
It was smooth.

23
00:01:40.492 --> 00:01:44.752
"I'm alone," said Eddy.

24
00:01:44.753 --> 00:01:49.054
"Now I can practice racing!"

25
00:01:49.055 --> 00:01:52.615
"Hey, slowpoke!" said a voice.

26
00:01:52.616 --> 00:01:57.937
Eddy groaned.

27
00:01:57.938 --> 00:02:08.497
It was Zippy.
